  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;Condition 5 attached to LBH/24006 of the original permission\r\nin which the dwellinghouse was built states the following:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;C15 Pursuant to Article 3(2) of the Town &amp;amp; Country\r\nPlanning General Development Order 1977 the provisions of Article 3(1) and\r\nClass 1 of Schedule 1 of the said Order (relating to development within the\r\ncurtilage of a dwellinghouse) shal not apply to any dwellinghouse to which this\r\npermission relates and no such development within the cuetialge of any such\r\ndwellinghouse shall be carried out without the permission of the local planning\r\nauthority being first obtained.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Reason: To restrict the amount of site coverage by buildings\r\nin relation to the size of the plot.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;As such, the application site does not benefit from\r\npermitted development rights and therefore cannot be assessed under Class\r\nA&amp;nbsp;from Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the Town and Country Planning\r\n(General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
